      "descriptions": [
        {
          "description": "This is the Global Dam Watch (GDW) database of river barriers and reservoirs, version 1.0. The database development is fully described in Lehner et al. 2024 (see DOI-link in References below).There are 2 zip files (one in Geodatabase format and one in Shapefile format):\"GDW_v1_0_gdb.zip\" contains both river barriers (points) and reservoirs (polygons) including all attribute information, in Geodatabase format\"GDW_v1_0_shp.zip\" contains both river barriers (points) and reservoirs (polygons) including all attribute information, in Shapefile format; additionally there is a comma delimited text file containing all barrier attributesEach of the zip-files contains a Technical Documentation (GDW_TechDoc_v1_0.pdf) which provides additional information. The GDW database is maintained by the Global Dam Watch initiative, see https://www.globaldamwatch.org.",
          "descriptionType": "Abstract"
        }
